# New design-system component — checklist

Use when adding or porting a **`Ds*`** primitive or composed component.

Related: **Design tokens & Tailwind** (`ui-rules/`), **Naming** (core), **Components & screens — structure** (`component-rules/`).

## 1. Naming & file placement

| Kind | File | Export |
|---|---|---|
| DS primitive | `components/ds/Ds{Name}.tsx` | `Ds{Name}` |
| DS composed | `components/ds/composed/Ds{Name}.tsx` (or subfolder) | `Ds{Name}` |
| Props type | same file | `TDs{Name}Props` |

**File name = exported symbol.** No `Screen` suffix on components.

## 2. Token hierarchy (mandatory)

```
primitives → semantic → component token → Ds*
```

- **Never** hardcode hex/rgb in components or component token files.
- **Never** import `design-tokens/primitives/*` from a `Ds*` component — only from token modules.
- Component token file references **`sl.*`** (semantic) only — not primitives.

### When to touch each layer

| Need | Action |
|---|---|
| New color role reused across UI | Add role in `design-tokens/semantic/colors.js` (or `semantic/typography.js`) |
| Component-specific mapping | Add `design-tokens/components/ds/{name}.js` (primitive) or `design-tokens/components/ds/composed/{name}.js` (composed), exporting `{ light, dark }` |
| New palette step only for one brand scale | Extend `design-tokens/primitives/colors.js`, then wire through semantic |

### `colors.js` — what belongs there

`design-tokens/components/colors.js` is the **NativeWind bridge** for screens / non-DS UI (`foreground`, `background`, `navigation`, `splash`, …).

**Do not** add isolated DS palettes (`button`, `tabs`, `chip`, …) to `colors.js`. Those live under **`design-tokens/components/ds/`** (primitives) or **`design-tokens/components/ds/composed/`** (composed) — JS-only, consumed via `style`.

## 3. Component token module

Mirrors `components/ds/` (primitives at `ds/`, composed under `ds/composed/`).

**Primitive** — `design-tokens/components/ds/{name}.js`:

```js
const semanticLight = require('../../semantic/colors').light;
const sl = semanticLight;

const light = {
  // map component slots → sl.* only
};

module.exports = { light, dark: {} };
```

**Composed** — `design-tokens/components/ds/composed/{name}.js` (same shape, `require('../../../semantic/colors')`).

- Sizes/spacing that are not semantic colors may pull from **primitives** inside the token file only (e.g. `icon.js` + `primitives/iconSize.js`).
- Update the **header comment** in `tailwind.config.js` when adding a new component token file.

## 4. Implement `Ds*`

- Consume tokens: `import xTokens from 'design-tokens/components/ds/{name}'` (or `…/ds/composed/{name}`) → `xTokens.light`.
- Prefer existing primitives: `DsText`, `DsIcon`, `DsButton` — not raw RN `Text` / inline colors.
- No `React.FC` — explicit `TDs{Name}Props`.
- Layout colors via the component token (`style`). **Never** `bg-light-*` / `text-light-*` from `colors.js` inside a `Ds*` file.

## 5. Barrel exports

- Export component + types from `components/ds/index.ts`.
- Composed components also from `components/ds/composed/index.ts`.

## 6. DevDebugMenu lab (required for new `Ds*`)

Mirror an existing lab (`DsChipDebug`, `DsTabsDebug`, …):

```
components/DevDebugMenu/ds/Ds{Name}/
  Ds{Name}Debug.tsx
  ds{Name}DebugSnippet.ts   # buildSnippet + describeProps for copy
```

Wire in `components/DevDebugMenu/DevDebugMenu.tsx`:

- `DebugCatalogRow` in **Primitives** or **Composed**
- state + `DsModalFullScreen` + close/hide callbacks

**Token-only modules** (no `Ds*` wrapper, e.g. `activityIndicator.js`): lab documents the token + lists DS consumers (`DsButton` loading, …).

To land `Ds*` + labs from a product branch onto stack `main`, use **`/promote-ds`**. Do not dump app widgets. Product style goes to `components/`, not a new composed `Ds*` — **Product apps do not override the DS**.

## 7. Quick validation before PR

- [ ] Component token → semantic → primitive chain intact
- [ ] No hex in component or component token files
- [ ] Isolated `design-tokens/components/ds/{name}.js` or `ds/composed/{name}.js` (not duplicated in `colors.js`)
- [ ] Barrel exports updated
- [ ] DevDebugMenu entry + simulator works in `__DEV__`
